                        "username": "JY-Voon"
                    },
                    "message": "Hardcoding these might requires rework after every updating, how about generating these info as follows:\n```\ncrow::Response expected;\nmessages::resourceNotFound(...);\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "test/redfish-core/lib/redfish_sessions_test.cpp",
                    "line": 49,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Disagree here.  The point of this test is to test the exact output.\n\nSome of this needs to have some fuzzy matching, but this looks mostly correct.\n\nWith that said, this function doesn't need to exist."
                },
                {
                    "file": "test/redfish-core/lib/redfish_sessions_test.cpp",
                    "line": 49,
