                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Why does this need to exist?  Arguments don't look correctly passed, and this is just constructing a user session.  Tests shouldn't have a magic way to construct these that's different than the common code."
                },
                {
                    "file": "test/redfish-core/lib/redfish_sessions_test.cpp",
                    "line": 78,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Joel Pullokaran Jesin",
                        "email": "joelpj@ami.com",
                        "username": "joel-pj"
                    },
                    "message": "Good point. This helper isn't strictly necessary and introduces a test-only path for constructing a UserSession. I'll update the test to use the common construction path instead, so it matches production usage."
                },
